            "created_at": "2025-09-26T05:13:15.200165+00:00",
            "notes": "We start by taking [Timelapse](item_20d43db5-d2ad-47e9-b32f-82d8eca006ce) as your first power. I believe this is the best first pick in the game because it helps you do more damage and farm more money in the early game. It also scales with Weapon Power, which we will be building during this game.\n\nFor items, it really is up to personal preference. My first choice is [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) for extra damage, (this helps with [Timelapse](item_20d43db5-d2ad-47e9-b32f-82d8eca006ce)). \n\nThen I take [Electrolytes](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900). This item's overhealth gained is not affected by Tracer's passive 25% health nerf from items, so it can be incredibly useful when chipped from far away. The alternative would be [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) for less consistent but useful extra health.\n\nI think [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) is the best green on Tracer. She is very good at hunting down and finishing low HP enemies, and this item shows you exactly where those enemies are.",
