            "notes": "In this round, I tend to pick items based on what the enemy is doing.\n\nI almost always pick [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) because it helps us do more damage while spamming our low cooldown abilities. \n\nIf the enemy is building armor or has an armor tank like [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85) and [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49), then I always take [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27). Armor is one of Tracer's biggest counters, so having the extra damage really is necessary.",
